{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-12-16 06:20:00', 'title': "CDP AWARDS LINDE DOUBLE ‘A' FOR CLIMATE CHANGE AND WATER SECURITY", 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / DECEMBER 16, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A DOUBLE 'A' FROM CDP FOR ITS APPROACH TO TACKLING BOTH WATER SECURITY AND CLIMATE CHANGE. CDP IS A GLOBAL NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION THAT WORKS WITH INVESTORS REPRESENTING OVER $130 TRILLION IN ASSETS TO MEASURE HOW COMPANIES MANAGE THEIR ENVIRONMENTAL RISK."}